                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 365.117/135.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Page to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Rome</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-08-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 24, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>383. Referring Department’s 282, July 12. Foreign Office reports today Da Prato
                    has been released.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nelson Page.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
